code/cars.tsv is adapted from Auto MPG by R. Quinlan, UCI Machine Learning
Repository, distributed under CC BY 4.0. The adaptation puts a binary gas-use
label in place of numeric MPG. The files in code/provided-results/ are computed
from that data and carry the same terms.
https://doi.org/10.24432/C5859H
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

code/DATA.md describes both data files and where they come from.
